### Audit Trail Requirements
- Track WHO made the change (user_id)
- Track WHAT changed (before/after values)
- Track WHEN it changed (timestamp)
- Track WHY it changed (reason/comment field)
- Track WHERE it was changed (IP address, device info)
- Never delete audit logs
- Implement tamper-proof audit logging

